WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:03.663
Searching for a receipt shouldn't mean searching every
conversation.

00:00:04.143 --> 00:00:09.477
Gmail attachments and Telegram receipt photos flow into
organized Drive folders.

00:00:09.957 --> 00:00:13.285
A matching spreadsheet row keeps the file and its source
together.

00:00:13.765 --> 00:00:17.327
Run the same email again, and the existing file is reused.

00:00:17.807 --> 00:00:22.159
If receipt details are unclear, missing fields stay blank
instead of being guessed.

00:00:22.639 --> 00:00:25.155
Documents filed. A trail you can follow.

